<LanguageData>
  <!-- EN: shipcracker warcasket -->
  <SCWC_Warcasket_Shipcracker.label>飞船突袭型战棺装甲</SCWC_Warcasket_Shipcracker.label>
  <!-- EN: Specialized spacer-tech warcasket shell with improved impact dispersion, fitted with fuel-burning drop thrusters for breaching jumps and a ranged shield. -->
  <SCWC_Warcasket_Shipcracker.shortDescription>特化型太空时代级别战棺装甲，配备改进型冲击力偏转模块与远程能量护盾，另装有燃料驱动的空降推进器，可执行破墙跳跃。</SCWC_Warcasket_Shipcracker.shortDescription>
  <!-- EN: Specialized spacer-tech warcasket shell with improved impact dispersion, fitted with fuel-burning drop thrusters for breaching jumps and a ranged shield.\n\nAn Imperial pattern, not a pirate one: boarding corps built it on the 10th-generation spacer chassis to cross the gap between two ships and open the far hull from the outside. Salvage and desertion have since put it in foundries far from any Imperial dock.\n\nA shipcracker launches through the vacuum, lands on the enemy hull, punches through to the interior and takes the ship room by room. Under gravity the same burn clears a wall or a roof in a single hop. The shield stops bullets, not blades: pilots are chosen for a taste for close work. -->
  <SCWC_Warcasket_Shipcracker.description>特化型太空时代级别战棺装甲，配备改进型冲击力偏转模块与远程能量护盾，另装有燃料驱动的空降推进器，可执行破墙跳跃。\n\n这是帝国的设计，不是海盗的。帝国登舰部队在第十代太空时代机体的基础上打造出这一型号，用来跨越两舰之间的空隙，从外侧破开敌舰的船体。后来有的从残骸中打捞出来，有的被逃兵带走，辗转流入远离帝国船坞的各地铸造厂。\n\n飞船突袭者穿越真空，降落在敌舰的船体上，打孔突入舰内，再逐个舱室夺下整艘船。到了有重力的地方，同样的推进也能一跃越过墙壁或屋顶。护盾挡得住子弹，挡不住刀锋，所以驾驶员专挑那些偏爱近身搏杀的人。</SCWC_Warcasket_Shipcracker.description>

  <!-- EN: shipcracker warcasket shoulders -->
  <SCWC_WarcasketShoulders_Shipcracker.label>飞船突袭型战棺护肩</SCWC_WarcasketShoulders_Shipcracker.label>
  <!-- EN: Specialized spacer-tech warcasket pauldrons with improved impact dispersion, equipped with melee assistor modules and hardened breaching arms that let a landing tear through plasteel. -->
  <SCWC_WarcasketShoulders_Shipcracker.shortDescription>特化型太空时代级别战棺护肩，配备改进型冲击力偏转模块与近战辅助模块，另装有强化破墙臂，着陆时连玻璃钢也能撕开。</SCWC_WarcasketShoulders_Shipcracker.shortDescription>
  <!-- EN: Specialized spacer-tech warcasket pauldrons with improved impact dispersion, equipped with melee assistor modules and hardened breaching arms that let a landing tear through plasteel.\n\nAn Imperial pattern, not a pirate one: boarding corps built it on the 10th-generation spacer chassis to cross the gap between two ships and open the far hull from the outside. Salvage and desertion have since put it in foundries far from any Imperial dock.\n\nA shipcracker launches through the vacuum, lands on the enemy hull, punches through to the interior and takes the ship room by room. Under gravity the same burn clears a wall or a roof in a single hop. The shield stops bullets, not blades: pilots are chosen for a taste for close work. -->
